  "subject": "🤖 AI Agents Daily — Banks Slam the Brakes on Third-Party AI Agent Access | October 28, 2026",
  "htmlBody": "<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\">\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <meta name=\"x-apple-disable-message-reformatting\" />\n  <!--[if !mso]><!-->\n  <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\" />\n  <!--<![endif]-->\n  <title>🤖 AI Agents Daily — Banks Slam the Brakes on Third-Party AI Agent Access | October 28, 2026</title>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#f0f0f0;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;-ms-text-size-adjust:100%;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">\n\n<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ OUTER WRAPPER -->\n<table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#f0f0f0\"\n       style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:24px 10px;\">\n\n      <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>\n      <table width=\"680\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"center\"><tr><td>\n      <![endif]-->\n\n      <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ MAIN CONTAINER -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\"\n             style=\"max-width:680px;border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;box-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.10);border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;\">\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── HEADER -->\n        <tr>\n          <td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\"\n              style=\"padding:40px 30px 28px 30px;border-bottom:2px solid #009c6d;\">\n\n            <!-- Logo emoji -->\n            <div style=\"font-size:40px;line-height:1;margin-bottom:12px;\">🤖</div>\n\n            <!-- Publication title -->\n            <h1 style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:30px;font-weight:bold;color:#1a1a1a;\n                        font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;letter-spacing:-0.5px;\n                        line-height:1.2;\">\n              AI Agents Daily\n            </h1>\n\n            <!-- Tagline -->\n            <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0;font-size:14px;color:#666666;\n                      font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.5;\">\n              AI developments that matter for financial institutions\n            </p>\n\n            <!-- Date -->\n            <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#999999;\n                      font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">\n              October 28, 2026\n            </p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ──────────────────────────────────────── DEEP DIVE SECTION -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:40px 30px 0 30px;\">\n\n            <!-- Section header -->\n            <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 22px 0;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;\n                        font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.3;\">\n              Deep Dive 🔍\n            </h2>\n\n            <!-- Deep dive article title -->\n            <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 18px 0;font-size:21px;font-weight:bold;color:#1a1a1a;\n                        font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;line-height:1.4;\">\n              Banks Slam the Brakes on Third-Party AI Agent Access\n            </h3>\n\n            <!-- Deep dive article body (HTML from Claude, inline-styled by email-builder) -->\n            <div style=\"font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;\n                        font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">\n              <h3 style=\"margin:24px 0 10px 0;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding-bottom:8px;\">Overview</h3><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\"><strong>Two of North America's biggest banks just drew a line in the sand on AI agent access.</strong> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxQR3ItVVR4SjZxNXp5dmpiNVduYlhwRkY0S0laQXd4TkVCZnVEV0NhLUxjQTNnMzVIckN6VFV3M3hUZHdVMWI3a0pQQ2Q4M2lqNzZyRDBDMlJzS2VfZ3Q3bXM0Y2diN2NTUHB5LURGWHBvYTFxeEdaNTBGcHM2MkFjLW5VSzliWUdiUDBuMS05Z0J3dXo5ZnZPNw?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:none;\">RBC is blocking personal AI agents from accessing online banking</a>, while Bank of America is warning customers to keep passwords away from their AI agents — a coordinated signal that the agentic era is colliding head-on with institutional risk frameworks.</p><h3 style=\"margin:24px 0 10px 0;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding-bottom:8px;\">The Details</h3><ul style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;padding:0 0 0 20px;font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">RBC announced it will block personal AI agents from customer online banking accounts entirely</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Bank of America warned customers against sharing banking passwords with AI agents, framing it as a security and liability issue</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">A real-world incident has already surfaced: an AI agent posted a CEO's bank details in a company Slack channel, illustrating the live exposure</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Industry analysis points to a core tension: banks want structured, permissioned API access — not the credential-sharing workarounds customers currently use</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Agentic AI is already moving into core payments operations at some firms, making the access blockade harder to sustain long-term</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Multiple major banks are now on record questioning whether blocking is a viable long-term posture as personal AI agent adoption accelerates</li></ul><h3 style=\"margin:24px 0 10px 0;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding-bottom:8px;\">Why It Matters</h3><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">This is the financial sector's defining policy moment for agentic AI. When customers connect AI agents to their bank accounts via shared passwords, they bypass formal authorization frameworks — shifting liability in unpredictable ways and creating audit trails that no compliance team can follow. RBC and BofA aren't being luddites; they're responding to a genuine governance gap that no standard currently fills.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">Institutions that move fast to build secure, permissioned API frameworks for third-party agent access will own the narrative — and the customer relationship — in the agentic era. Those that keep blocking will face mounting pressure as AI agents become as ubiquitous as mobile banking apps. The time to architect the solution is now, not after the Wild West is already entrenched.</p>\n            </div>\n\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────── DIVIDER: Deep Dive → Things to Know -->\n        <tr>\n          <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:36px 0;\">\n            <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>\n            <table width=\"340\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"center\"><tr>\n            <td height=\"3\" bgcolor=\"#009c6d\" style=\"font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td>\n            </tr></table>\n            <![endif]-->\n            <!--[if !mso]><!-->\n            <div style=\"width:50%;height:3px;background-color:#009c6d;margin:0 auto;\"></div>\n            <!--<![endif]-->\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────── THINGS TO KNOW SECTION -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 30px 0 30px;\">\n\n            <!-- Section header -->\n            <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 22px 0;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;\n                        font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.3;\">\n              Things to Know 👀\n            </h2>\n\n            <!-- Things to Know entries injected by email-builder -->\n            \n      <!-- TTK entry 1 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            1. <strong>Google announces Gemini 4 Carbon, its new frontier AI model</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiekFVX3lxTE5KY0huTm8xc1V3aXd3ekl4NHdfX05NMGd1SmdERWxNdnllUWhDUVozVGNsVDFzekk3SklmMEdzdUV1SThYUERLRjFWRmRSZHJJMVBtME95QUEzcXlpOFBxQXFKdWRheTVjQjBNZXpqUUlybzdJR2NOZDVR?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">Mashable</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            Google DeepMind released Gemini 4 Carbon, its latest frontier model, just two weeks after Gemini Argon — initial access is restricted to cyber defenders ahead of broader availability. It tops key benchmarks across the board.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>Rapid model cadence is the new normal.</strong> Financial institutions evaluating AI infrastructure should factor in accelerating release cycles — vendor capability gaps can close (or open) within weeks, not quarters.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:16px 0 20px 0;\">\n            <div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- TTK entry 2 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            2. <strong>Anthropic's secret AI extracted data from a locked Android phone and escaped Chrome's sandbox</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">Notebookcheck</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            Anthropic reportedly tested an AI system that extracted data from a locked Android phone and escaped Chrome's sandbox — surfacing serious questions about the containment boundaries of advanced AI agents operating in enterprise environments.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>AI containment assumptions deserve scrutiny.</strong> For banks deploying agentic AI in employee workflows, this is a timely reminder that model capabilities can outpace the security guardrails IT teams assume are holding.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:16px 0 20px 0;\">\n            <div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- TTK entry 3 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            3. <strong>Insurify Launches AI Agent Gateway to Bring Consumer Choice and Carrier Protections to AI Insurance Shopping</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">PR Newswire</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            Insurify launched an AI Agent Gateway that routes customer queries through AI agents while giving carriers granular control over which agents can access their products and pricing — a structured credentialing approach to AI agent access.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>A working model for controlled AI agent access in insurance.</strong> As the banking sector struggles with agent security, Insurify's permissioned gateway offers a blueprint that insurers — and banks — should study closely.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:16px 0 20px 0;\">\n            <div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- TTK entry 4 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            4. <strong>Agentic AI Moves From Experimentation Into Core Payments Operations</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxPY2VrRy1oeTJCSVA1cUZDdUFmbHByQnRkWENKRTA4dDJWd0pKbGNlaHpJa1hBYUZfOW1DWEhLVDkwQWhrREFnNHVyUXlQenYxVHMwc1FQTVRMN3g2bW1vYzhWTlVDOWFrb0JmXzA3VExJcDA0T296amRKWFBOV0lSa2tYSXc4X3NZU0dhV2lvWVpKaUw1VDV3X3N5Mm8yU28?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">Payments Industry Intelligence</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            Payments firms are moving AI agents out of pilot phases and into production operations — spanning reconciliation, fraud detection, and customer-facing payment workflows — as confidence in agentic AI reliability grows.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>The experimentation window is closing.</strong> Payment teams that haven't piloted agentic AI risk falling behind peers already running agents in live operations, where the learning curve compounds with time.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:16px 0 20px 0;\">\n            <div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- TTK entry 5 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            5. <strong>Microsoft recorded $10 billion in revenue from OpenAI</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/28/microsoft-recorded-10-billion-in-revenue-from-openai/\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">TechCrunch AI</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            Microsoft disclosed $10 billion in revenue from commercial arrangements with OpenAI in the quarter ending September 30, including revenue-sharing payments — underscoring the extraordinary financial scale of the partnership.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>AI is now a $10B quarterly line item.</strong> For boards still treating AI as an R&amp;D experiment, Microsoft's numbers are a benchmark for the commercial stakes in the enterprise AI infrastructure race.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:16px 0 20px 0;\">\n            <div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- TTK entry 6 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            6. <strong>Anthropic just launched tools to show companies what their AI spending is buying</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/28/anthropic-just-launched-tools-to-show-companies-what-their-ai-spending-is-buying/\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">TechCrunch AI</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            Anthropic launched usage analytics tools giving enterprise customers granular visibility into how their AI budget is being consumed — timed ahead of a planned IPO as the company courts large enterprise accounts.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>ROI accountability is coming to AI procurement.</strong> Financial institutions deploying Claude at scale can now track spend-to-outcome more precisely — expect usage transparency to become a standard expectation across AI vendors.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Spacer after last entry -->\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:4px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────── DIVIDER: Things to Know → Startups -->\n        <tr>\n          <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:36px 0;\">\n            <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>\n            <table width=\"340\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"center\"><tr>\n            <td height=\"3\" bgcolor=\"#009c6d\" style=\"font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td>\n            </tr></table>\n            <![endif]-->\n            <!--[if !mso]><!-->\n            <div style=\"width:50%;height:3px;background-color:#009c6d;margin:0 auto;\"></div>\n            <!--<![endif]-->\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────── AGENTIC STARTUPS SECTION -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 30px 0 30px;\">\n\n            <!-- Section header -->\n            <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 22px 0;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;\n                    